ITest Listners -> it is class, which contains method, implemented from ITest Listners.
Defn:IT is a Interface, which is already there in TestNG.

Steps -> 
1.Create Test Case
2.Create Listner Class
3.Create Xml file and include both Test case & Listners class.

15-04-2025
2 ways to implement listener classs
-----------------------------------
Method1
--------
class myListener implements ITListener {

}
Method2
--------
class myListener extends TestListenerAdapter {

}

How you can implements TestNG Listeners ->by using ITListener and TestListenerAdapater.
